The anchor set was center, top_left and bottom_center; `top_left` pinned
the window's own corner, which read as a different kind of anchor from the
other two. It becomes a consistent set of five: `center` for the window's
own centre, `left` and `right` for those edges of the usable area at its
vertical middle, `top_center` and `bottom_center` for those edges at its
horizontal middle.

